{
  "display": "form",
  "name": "processDataForm",
  "title": "Process data overview",
  "type": "form",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "content",
      "key": "uitleg",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "html": "<h3>What each table is, and where it comes from</h3><p>Every table below is one content component. Its heading is the expression that produced it, so you can read off exactly what was asked for and from which source. <code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(zaak.zaakdata) &#125;&#125;</code> renders every key the object holds, so none of these keys are authored by hand &mdash; which is the point, because the process variables differ per process and per run.</p><p>A nested object shows as <code>{n}</code> and a list as <code>[n]</code>, n being the number of entries; address those with their own expression to look inside. The last panel holds expressions that cannot work; note that none of them report anything in the form &mdash; a wrong expression renders empty or <code>[object Object]</code>, never a message.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Read from the zaak",
      "key": "from_zaak",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "zaak_note",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<p>Source: the zaak as read live from Open Zaak over the ZGW API, plus its Flowable variables under <code>zaakdata</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDzaak_zaakdata_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(zaak.zaakdata) &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ sleutels(zaak.zaakdata) }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "divider_zaak_1",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<hr class=\"zac-gegevens-divider\">"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDzaak_zaaktype_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(zaak.zaaktype) &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ sleutels(zaak.zaaktype) }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "divider_zaak_2",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<hr class=\"zac-gegevens-divider\">"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDzaak_groep_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(zaak.groep) &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ sleutels(zaak.groep) }}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Read from the taak",
      "key": "from_taak",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "taak_note",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<p>Source: the Flowable task row and its task-local variables. Note that <code>taakdata</code> is not what this form submitted: ZAC merges every process variable into it on each open, which is why zaak fields appear here. <code>zaakUUID</code> and <code>zaaktypeUUID</code> are filtered out of that merge.</p>"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDtaak_taakdata_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(taak.taakdata) &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ sleutels(taak.taakdata) }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "divider_taak_1",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<hr class=\"zac-gegevens-divider\">"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDtaak_taakinformatie_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(taak.taakinformatie) &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ sleutels(taak.taakinformatie) }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "divider_taak_2",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<hr class=\"zac-gegevens-divider\">"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDtaak_rechten_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(taak.rechten) &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ sleutels(taak.rechten) }}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Deliberate mistake",
      "key": "deliberate_mistakes",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PD_fout_scalar",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(zaak.identificatie) &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ sleutels(zaak.identificatie) }}"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PD_fout_typefout",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; zaak.kommunikatiekanaal &#125;&#125;</code> (misspelled): </span>{{ zaak.kommunikatiekanaal }}"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PD_fout_wildcard_na_lijst",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; sleutels(lijst(zaak.kenmerken)) &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ sleutels(lijst(zaak.kenmerken)) }}"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PD_fout_object_zonder_wildcard",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\"><code>&#123;&#123; zaak.zaaktype &#125;&#125;</code>: </span>{{ zaak.zaaktype }}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "save",
      "label": "Save",
      "type": "button",
      "theme": "secondary",
      "input": true,
      "action": "saveState",
      "state": "draft",
      "tableView": false
    },
    {
      "type": "button",
